e used.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Culture confirmation of TB diagnosis was significantly higher in symptomatic patients than in those diagnosed through a screening procedure (77% versus 56%; p<0.001).\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}